# GUARD ts-navigation-completion-isolation
#
# The original single completion slot allowed a snapshot request to erase an
# independently keyed catalog completion. The break restores that erasure;
# polling the snapshot must still leave the catalog reply pending and readable.
test: navigation bridge preserves independently pending catalog and snapshot completions
